@bank dept:works
// Head writer 0607: the Works crew at work where you can see them (the systems engineer's, plan-0607 "The Works crew
// at work"). crewjob.repair while they fix something near you, crewjob.carry while they carry a box (bubbles, 60).

== crewjob.repair
- Come on, {machine}. Be nice to me.
- There we are. Nearly. Nearly.
- Who keeps breaking this? Oh. Nobody. It's just old.   #funny
- Panel off, part in, job done. Lovely.
- Hold still. I'm only helping.   #funny
- That's the fluff out. Breathe, little vent.
- Hear that? Better already.

== crewjob.carry
- Coming through! Box with legs.   #funny
- Mind your toes. Heavy one.
- Delivery for Deck 3. Again.
- Sorry, squeezing past. Thanks.
- This one's for the galley. Smells like it, too.
